# Rust
/target/
/apps/desktop/target/

# Generated: Tauri's permission and capability schemas, written by tauri-build
/apps/desktop/gen/

# Node
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*

# Angular build output
/apps/web/dist/
/apps/web/.angular/
/apps/web/out-tsc/

# Generated: the WASM package, produced by `npm run wasm:build`
/apps/web/public/wasm/

# Generated: content mirrored from /content by scripts/sync-content.mjs
/apps/web/public/content/

# Local environment: which content directory this machine authors against.
# `.env.example` documents it and is committed.
/.env

# Editors / OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp

# Client deliveries produced by `just deliver`
/deliveries/

# Smoke-test runs and their local baseline, written by the verify-no-regression
# skill. The baseline is per-machine on purpose: it holds screenshots taken by
# this machine's browser and fonts.
/.smoke/

# Generated: documentation and sketches produced by ia to help with design and implementation. These are not source files, but rather artifacts of the design process.
/docs/implementing-*.md
/docs/sketch*.png
